  "prefLabel": "En 1801.01 Purpose",
  "recordType": "rule-section",
  "ruleText": "En 1801.01 Purpose. En 1800 governs the procedures for submission to the department and the department’s review of the residential energy code compliance form for projects in municipalities that do not have an adopted code enforcement mechanism in accordance with RSA 155-A:10-a.\n\nSource. #14381, eff 9-22-25, EXPIRES: 9-22-35",
